cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "osquery-nvidia-gpu: an nvidia_gpu table for osquery"
abstract: >
  An osquery extension that adds an nvidia_gpu table: one row per NVIDIA card,
  with utilisation, VRAM, power, temperature and clock, read from nvidia-smi.
authors:
  - family-names: Lee
    given-names: "K. S. Ernest (iFire)"
    email: ernest.lee@chibifire.com
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-4570-1436"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/fire/osquery-nvidia-gpu"
keywords:
  - osquery
  - nvidia
  - gpu
  - nvidia-smi
